{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20289","headline":"董逃行 · 张籍","name":"董逃行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳城头火曈曈，乱兵烧我天子宫。\n宫城南面有深山，尽将老幼藏其间。\n重岩爲屋橡爲食，丁男夜行候消息。\n闻道官军犹掠人，旧里如今归未得。\n董逃行，汉家几时重太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}